  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assistance alimentaire et nutritionnelle d&#x2019;urgence aux personnes d&#xe9;plac&#xe9;es internes (PDIs), communaut&#xe9;s h&#xf4;tes et r&#xe9;fugi&#xe9;s</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to food and nutrition assistance to people in IPC phases 3,4, and 5 in Gao, Menaka and Mopti to prevent famine-like conditions, and to newly-arrived refugees in Mopti, Bandiagara and San. This WFP project provides food assistance to targeted people affected by these crises through e-vouchers, and provides nutrition assistance in kind and through vouchers to prevent and treat moderate acute malnutrition (MAM). The project provides humanitarian assistance to 128,600 people, including almost 42,000 women, over 46,300 children, and including over 18,000 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
